                "category": "defensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature opens a cell door</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The triggering creature and each creature within 10 feet of them must attempt a @Check[will|dc:32|options:area-effect,damaging-effect] save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected and becomes immune to the effects of warpline hazards for 1 hour.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes @Damage[(3d10+14)[electricity]|options:area-damage] damage as their nerves jolt with painful energy. For 1 day, each time the creature takes damage, they must spend at least one action on their next turn to Stride (or to Burrow, Climb, Fly, or Swim, if they have the corresponding movement type). If they don't, they take @Damage[(3d10+14)[electricity]] damage at the end of their turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, except the effect lasts 1 week.</p>"
